## 4. Data Architecture & Entity Relationships

### 4.1 Data Storage Philosophy
- **Structured Data:** Stored in relational tables with foreign keys and cascade rules.
- **Unstructured Assets:** Uploaded directly to cloud object storage. Only public/signed URLs are stored in the database.

### 4.2 Core Data Dictionary

| Entity / Table | Field | Data Type | Constraints | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **users** | `id` | UUID / TEXT | Primary Key | Unique user identifier |
| | `email` | VARCHAR(255) | UNIQUE, NOT NULL | Primary login email |
| | `role` | ENUM | NOT NULL | User role (USER, ADMIN) |
| | `created_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | DEFAULT NOW() | Record creation timestamp |
| **[entity_2]** | `id` | UUID / INT | Primary Key | Record identifier |
| | `user_id` | UUID | FK -> users(id) | Owner association |

