## 7. Deployment & Operational Guide

### 7.1 Environment Variables Matrix

| Variable Key | Required | Example / Format | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `DATABASE_URL` | Yes | `postgresql://user:pass@host/db` | Connection string for database |
| `NEXTAUTH_SECRET` | Yes | `64-char random hex` | Cryptographic session signing key |
| `STORAGE_BUCKET_KEY` | Yes | `alphanumeric` | Object storage credentials |

### 7.2 Run & Build Commands
- **Install Dependencies:** `npm install`
- **Development Server:** `npm run dev`
- **Database Migration:** `npx prisma migrate dev`
- **Production Build:** `npm run build`
